Note = {International Conference on Business, Management, Tourism and
   Hospitality (BIZMATOUR), Malacca, MALAYSIA, MAY 12-14, 2015},
Abstract = {This study will research the reflections of the activities led by the
   recreation leaders on their lifestyles, who are one of the key factors
   of leisure time industry, and their serious leisure time tendencies. For
   this purpose, five nature group leaders were interviewed in Eskisehir,
   whose contact information were reached and who agreed to interview. The
   answers given to the research questions, which were determined in line
   with the purpose of the research, were analyzed by descriptive analysis
   method, one of the qualitative research methods. With this study, it is
   aimed to reveal the opinions of recreation leaders regarding leisure
   time, in what ways they make use of their leisure time, how do the
   activities led by these recreational leaders reflect on their lifestyles
   and the tendency of these leisure time leadership activities to become
   serious leisure time.},
