   Inst Architects; Hong Kong Institut Engineers; Hong Kong Inst Surveyors;
   HKSTS; IUE; JSCE; RICS; Urban Planning Soc China; China Civil Engn Soc},
Abstract = {Industrial closed water circulation is an important link of sustainable
   urban development. In this paper, combining the experience of carrying
   out cleaner production audit in enterprises relating to
   microelectronics, steel, auto parts and etc located in the urban area,
   examining the current domestic and overseas industrial water circulation
   process technology, the author brings forward that the treatment of
   industrial wastewater in the urban area should adopt closed water
   circulation technology. This paper analyzes the existing major problems
   of the industrial wastewater recycling, and makes statement about how to
   apply environmental biotechnology, advanced oxidation technology,
   membrane technology and etc to realize industrial closed water
   circulation. This research provides reference to the cleaning,
   production and environment management of the industrial enterprises
   during the urban sustainable development process.},
