Note = {International Conference on Computer and Network Applications (ICCNA),
   Kota Kinabalu, MALAYSIA, SEP 05-06, 2017},
Abstract = {Color is a fundamental element of the design that most people respond to
   first, and affects various areas such as culture, art, environment,
   education, and content. Especially, the color in the game amplifies the
   emotion and is an important factor to improve the game sustainability.
   In this study, we tried to use color extraction programs that people
   commonly use, and since they are not specialized in games and are
   uncomfortable, they have difficulty in color analysis and design and
   implementation of color extraction program. It simplifies the color
   extraction method of a single image, processes multiple image files at
   the same time, displays RGB accumulated values as a histogram, and shows
   10 commonly used colors in order. Also, the reliability was verified by
   comparing the numerical values using a photo shot program. Through the
   color image extraction program, it is expected that it will help the
   game planning through the color analysis of the image information more
   quickly and easily, and it will help to study the color tendency and
   color characteristic of the gamer in the future.},
