Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {In China, no matter in South or in North, facing south is always the
   best residential orientation. However, restricted by the direction of
   urban roads, some landscapes and other factors, it is impossible for all
   residences to face south. By dynamic energy-consumption imitation and
   analysis CHEC software, the authors calculated a lot of
   energy-conserving residences of different orientations in Hunan,
   analyzed the influence of orientation change on heating air-condition's
   energy consumption and indoor hot environment and found the change
   disciplines. In the end, the authors put out the most ideal orientation
   scope of energy-conserving residence, which can be used as reference
   when planning and designing energy-conserving residence.},
