Abstract = {The dynamic vision of a driver is the most relevant factor to the
   occurrence of traffic accidents. Based on the analysis of characters of
   driver's vision behaviors and their information-processing routines, the
   dependence of driver's vision characteristics on driving speed was
   studied and the reaction time of driver was obtained. Furthermore, the
   weight factors of the layout of instrument board were calculated and
   dynamic reaction model was built. Novel design of the layout of
   operation envelope was discussed based on the reaction time of driver.},
