Abstract = {The social and psychological peculiarities of image appearance formation
   in the human interaction process are found out in the article. The basic
   mechanisms and phenomena that affect the interethnic perception process
   are anylized. A research procedural and methodological support is
   proposed. The basic directions of face research as the means of
   communication are found out. The stages of experimental part of research
   are described. The main results of research are discussed and
   illustrated with empirical data. The role of interethnic face perception
